SOP Uploading Extension (Microsoft Edge)

1. go to edge://extensions
2. click on the 3 bars in the top left corner and find 'Developer Mode' (bottom left corner)
3. turn on 'Developer Mode' by clicking the small toggle nxt to the words 'Developer Mode'
4. to the upper right, where the extensions are listed, there should be three icons. Click the icon furthest to the left to upload files or 'load'
5. find the folder with the accom_extension files in file explorer and select the folder
6. make sure the extension is on by clicking the small puzzle piece in the top right corner of the window, to the left of the profile icon

The only things you need to get this extension into your browser is to have the files in your Documents or saved somewhere in your files. 
